  "releaseNotes": "Release Notes v6.0.0. - Targets .NetStandard 2.1, .Net 9.0 and .Net 10.0\n      Library to Implement Feature Toggles to hide/show program features with File system storage.\n\n      Major v6.0.0 Release Features:\n      - OpenFeature Specification (v1.x) provider compatibility via FeatureOne.OpenFeature package\n      - RelationalCondition with 5 relational operators (Equals, NotEquals, GreaterThan, GreaterThanOrEqual, LessThanOrEqual)\n      - Framework support for .NET Standard 2.1, .NET 9.0, and .NET 10.0",
